OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACovid inquiry urges UK`Ireland
OL,4,Apandemic co-ordination in future
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the pandemic, Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fchose to align its international border
OL,8,Fcontrol measures with the UK rather
OL,9,Fthan with the Republic.
OL,11,FInquiry chair Dame Heather Hallett said
OL,12,Fthat despite this decision, there was
OL,13,Fclose liaison between the UK
OL,14,Fgovernment, devolved administrations
OL,15,Fand the Irish government.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
